123
00:04:13,280 --> 00:04:15,680
In the story, a Simple Domain can cancel

124
00:04:15,680 --> 00:04:17,080
a domain's guaranteed hit.

125
00:04:17,840 --> 00:04:18,320
Our guess:

126
00:04:18,940 --> 00:04:21,460
someone who is completely calm is the closest

127
